	(text "ZWT, not PTP-176: all 32 ePWM outputs sit on ZWT-only balls GPIO137-168 (PTP has them only on GPIO0-31,\ncolliding with SPI/SDFM/CAN/eQEP), and ZWT bonds all 24 ADC inputs (PTP lacks B4, B5, C5, D5).\nHRPWM exists on ePWM1-8 only = ports C1 and C2. Unused GPIOs: no-connect (table 6-12, firmware pull-up).\nNC2 (J18) tied to VDDIO as the datasheet recommends; FLT1/FLT2 must stay open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 200.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e97d6bab-457f-5cec-8787-e981fd05a25e")
	)
